    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Given a $4/$8 cash session between hands, When the user chooses Leave table in the header, Then the session ends, no further hand is dealt and the Session Report for that session opens [REQ-004.5]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Given the bust dialog after the user's stack reached $0, When the user chooses Leave table, Then the Session Report for that session opens [REQ-004.5]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Given a $4/$8 cash session of 214 hands with 1 rebuy that ends with a final stack of $366, When its report is shown, Then it shows Result \"+$46\", BB/100 \"+2.7\" and rebuys \"1\" [REQ-007.3, REQ-044.1]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Given a $4/$8 cash session of 100 hands with no rebuys that ends with a final stack of $120, When its report is shown, Then it shows Result \"-$40\", BB/100 \"-5.0\" and rebuys \"0\" [REQ-044.1]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Given a session has ended and its report was shown, When the app is closed and relaunched, Then the stored report for that session holds the same values and no paused session exists for it [REQ-044.7]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Given a stored session report, When later sessions are played and ended, Then the stored report is byte-identical and a second write for the same session id is rejected [REQ-044.7, REQ-052.5]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Given a session with 0 completed hands (the app was closed during hand 1), When that session is ended, Then no Session Report opens and neither the session nor a report is stored [REQ-044.8]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Given the Hand Review panel is open after hand 12 of a cash session, When the user chooses Leave table, Then no dialog is shown, no hand 13 is dealt and the Session Report opens showing hands played \"12\" [REQ-004.5]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Given the Table header's Leave table control, When it is chosen, Then App's onLeave handler ends the session and opens the Session Report instead of returning straight to Home (replacing the TASK-3.3 interim behaviour)",
